dels, transformers, CNNs and RNNs be decomposed into circuit-representable operations."}, {"id": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_lilith", "label": "Lilith Compute Cluster", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "references/recursion/ch3/ref-72-ezkl-modulus-docs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://docs.ezkl.xyz/", "captured_at": "2026-06-13", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Local proof generation limits very large models and rapid concurrent verification, so Lilith offloads proving to a remote high-performance cluster, mirroring the ezkl CLI and offering REST API access for concurrent, low-latency proof generation."}], "edges": [{"source": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs", "target": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_ezkl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "references/recursion/ch3/ref-72-ezkl-modulus-docs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_ezkl", "target": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_halo2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "references/recursion/ch3/ref-72-ezkl-modulus-docs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_ezkl", "target": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_onnx", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "references/recursion/ch3/ref-72-ezkl-modulus-docs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_lilith", "target": "references_recursion_ch3_ref_72_ezkl_modulus_docs_ezkl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "references/recursion/ch3/ref-72-ezkl-modulus-docs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"